  "goodToKnow": "Der Nordwesten is the north-west: im Nordwesten Deutschlands (Lower Saxony, Bremen, East Frisia), aus Nordwesten (from the north-west). All compass directions are masculine: der Norden, der Osten, der Süden, der Westen, der Nordosten, der Südwesten. Adjectives: nordwestlich (von). Weather reports often mention Nordwestwind bringing rain from the North Sea. It has no plural."
